            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Corral 0.2.0</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>Snap to Grid overlay.</b> Press ⌃⌥Space (or the menu bar) to bring up a grid on your screen, drag to pick a region, and the focused window snaps to it. The window is outlined in blue so you can see what will move.</li>
  <li>Rebindable overlay shortcut in Settings ▸ Grid.</li>
  <li>New About window.</li>
  <li>If Corral earns its keep, there are now optional donation options in Settings and About.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
